# The context is what the Dockerfile COPYs and nothing else - same rule as the other three modules,
# and the same trap: a new COPY without a line here fails with `failed to compute cache key`.
#
# It also keeps `frontend/` out, which matters here more than anywhere else: node_modules is tens of
# thousands of files and would be uploaded to the daemon on every build for an image that does not
# contain a single one of them.
*
!build/libs/*.jar

# The thin jar back out again: shadowJar leaves both side by side and the COPY uses a glob. Two
# matches is not an error - BuildKit picks one and says nothing.
build/libs/*-thin.jar
